    },
    {
      "id": "g4",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "5 \u00b7 DECIDE",
      "x": 1640,
      "y": -80,
      "width": 1060,
      "height": 650,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "swipe",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Research\n**[[Swipe Method]]**\nAd Library \u00b7 Reddit \u00b7 App Store reviews\n`30 min, every Tue`",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 130
    },
    {
      "id": "matrix",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Pick the angle\n**[[Messaging Matrix]]**\nA1 \u2026 A6 \u2014 one row = one test",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "hooks",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Write the hook\n**[[Hooks & Angles]]**\nHis words, not ours",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "brief",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Brief\n**[[Creative Brief]]**\nHook \u00b7 beats \u00b7 copy \u00b7 specs",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "produce",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Produce\nUGC \u00b7 demo \u00b7 static \u00b7 before/after\n9:16 + 1:1 + 4:5",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "qa",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### QA\n**[[Production Pipeline]]**\nHook <1.5s \u00b7 silent-readable\nMen only \u00b7 AI disclosure\nNo unsourced stat",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "name",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Name it\n**[[Creative Naming]]**\n`WP_A1_UGC_100ms_9x16_v1`",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 510,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "config",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Account ready\n**[[Configuration]]**\nSDK \u00b7 AEM \u00b7 SKAN values\nEvent priority set",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 130
    },
    {
      "id": "campaign",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Campaign\nCBO \u00b7 broad \u00b7 Advantage+\n7d click / 1d view\n`WP | AppInstalls | US | 2026-09`",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 130
    },
    {
      "id": "struct",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Test structure\n**[[Creative Testing Protocol]]**\n1 ad set \u00b7 control + 3 variants\n**One variable only**",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 130
    },
    {
      "id": "hypo",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Write the hypothesis\n**[[Experiment Log]]**\n\u26a0\ufe0f BEFORE launch. Always.",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 510,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "launch",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Launch",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "learn",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Learning phase\n~50 events / week / ad set\n**Do not touch it**",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 130
    },
    {
      "id": "thresh",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Judgement threshold\n1,000 impressions per ad\n3\u00d7 target CPT spent\nMax 7 days",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 310,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 140
    },
    {
      "id": "track",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Log it\n**[[Tracker]]** \u2014 every Monday\nOne row per ad",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 490,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "read",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Read the funnel\n**[[KPI]]**\nCPM \u2192 CTR \u2192 Store CVR\n\u2192 Install\u2192Trial \u2192 Trial\u2192Paid\n*Fix the worst step only*",
      "x": 1680,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 140
    },
    {
      "id": "scale",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### SCALE\nBeats CPT 3 days straight\n**+20\u201330% / 24h max**",
      "x": 1680,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "kill",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### KILL\n1,000 impr \u00b7 CTR <0.6%\n\u00b7 0 installs",
      "x": 2020,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "iterate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### ITERATE\nNew variant off the winner\nChange one thing",
      "x": 2360,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "lesson",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Write the lesson\n**[[Experiment Log]]** \u00b7 **[[Retired Angles]]**\n*A dead ad with no lesson\nis wasted budget twice.*",
      "x": 2020,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "rules",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Rules that don't bend\n**One variable per test.** \u00b7 **Hypothesis before launch.** \u00b7 **Never judge inside the learning phase.** \u00b7 **Every kill gets a lesson.** \u00b7 **Guardrails before creative \u2192 [[Brand Guardrails]] \u00b7 [[Meta Ad Policy]] \u00b7 [[Claims & Proof]]**",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 880,
      "width": 1240,
      "height": 120
    }
  ],
